WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.180
Step 1. Open the prescriptions.

1.2
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:07.162
You can print the selected prescription, or every prescription of the encounter.

1.3
00:00:07.162 --> 00:00:11.585
Open the Medications tab and stay on the Prescriptions sub-tab.

2.1
00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:16.891
Step 2. Select what to print. Select the prescription, then select Print.

2.2
00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:20.562
To print every prescription of the encounter instead,

2.3
00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:23.210
select Print All Prescriptions.

3.1
00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.627
Step 3. Print the prescription.

3.2
00:00:25.627 --> 00:00:30.729
Care opens a print page with a preview of the prescription. Select Print.

3.3
00:00:30.729 --> 00:00:34.235
You can also press p on this page to print.
